Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have just abandoned that useless human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,With you by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time to put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give the monsters a chance to counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, the rounds from V Shipping are quite effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say our luck's turned around!{Is this the phrase?}{if it was going badly for them and now is going well, then yes.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem that the army's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even our marvelous brethren might not hold for long.{this is a really interesting line, tell me more about it. sarcasm? sycophantary? a mixture?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be no real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I do regret that I won't be able to watch the last two Sirius fight to the death. {Siriuses?}{i think Sirius is fine if it's clear it's plural, so i added "two"}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man.{you're actually so good}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has the army started a firefight in my mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it's too dangerous to leave right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to talk to their commander! They seem to think that they're stationed in Ryojun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, Mister Willard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We mobilized all of these troops in order to get revenge for the incident during the exercises in Fuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:31.88,Default,,2,2,0,,We {\i1}will{\i0} find the Alma Company manager who tried to sell\Nus a monster by calling it a "new type of weapon," right?{do they use the same term for Alma every time? I've been changing it to Alma Company because of that note you wrote a few episodes ago about it being written that way on the contract.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't come at me with a mind to kill, you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a vampire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Soft.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You really aren't cut out for taking revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can take my place, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else can put the souls of Mom and the other villagers to rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you'll be able to take your revenge by killing every vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before you'll be able to kill all of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they will surely reach what they seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Ark is long—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. When they came to Dogville ten years ago it was already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Dad left with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Make use of what my vampire blood{i.e. vampire-ness} has taken from me, and do the thing that only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned impudent humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Willard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Willard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is quite the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd doubted my ears when I was told that there was a remnant of the Sirius among the Jaegers,{"I admit I'd entertained the thought when I heard that there was a Sirius among the Jaegers," with the thought being that Willard was among them too is how I would normally interpret this line, but the next line forces me to imterpret it  this way against my gut feeling.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're his owner then everything makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You look older, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years is a terribly long time for a human, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's been a long time indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kershner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you would have been better suited for the lectern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Mikhail dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}My brother{*Nii-san} disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So he chose the life of his brother over his loyalty to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What a useless mongrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems awfully fond of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth did you tame him so well after what you did to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the fiend yourself, Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!{you're actually so good}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In place of your taciturn master, I'll tell you a story!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to thank me at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, we obtained a certain ancient text.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:15.86,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,In it was a story about the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In it was also written its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The location of Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't these flames remind you of the ones you saw that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My story is not yet over, little Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We were having trouble deciphering the contents of that text, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we decided to have a certain human archaeologist do it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,An impoverished scholar who was passionately investigating the location of the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When we presented him with an offer of patronage, he jumped at the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was ever so thankful, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He did excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that scholar making sense of the text for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we were able to lift the veil on Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what I'm trying to say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible!{Search your feelings, you know it to be true, Yuliy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the foolish pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It is as he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Great fortune is upon you, remnant of the Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of the men you must kill are gathered before you tonight!{this script is fucking FIRE. hi five japanese writers, hi five unbased}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've finally shown your true nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that we would one day have to depend on the treasure of a people so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You inelegant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you never tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all because of my ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.13,0:10:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that saving a young wolf who'd lost his family and kin would serve as my atonement.{kin is too close to family, I think. Family and tribe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I led you to choose revenge as a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I ended up using you as a tool for my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I was really one of the targets of {\i1}yours{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought I could live with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so long as the moment you learned the truth was the moment I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's all these ten years were?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the blood of a beast—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With my Sirius blood washing my vision red,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,my hand stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:14.74,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,You've been my rock for all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because you were like a father to me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you, my story would have ended then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because you were there for me that I've lived this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did my mother and the other villagers have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did my brother have to become a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all because of the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Willard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As the remnant of the Sirius,\NI must know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a chewing-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a report?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There were no corpses to be found at the scene of last night's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The police are losing their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.29,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that there's some advantage to turning to ash when you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Vampires," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still having trouble believing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you think that General Kakizaki and the soldiers who died at Fuji can rest in peace now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing with the Ninth Floor Annex? {Is that right?}{Yes}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A good old fashioned order to disband due to abuse of authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading back to Harbin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They told me to be glad I'm not being court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not been told?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There was someone else who's issued a summons for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha... wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:05.88,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{*}M-Miss Ryouko{*O-Ojou-sama}!{added stutter}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What... The mansion! The dojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't hurt, but the shock of it all has left him unable to get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, {*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,V Shipping will pay reparations for the house and everything else lost in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,T-They will?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish vampires would rip down my wreck of a house back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What are you people say—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Yuliy{**-san} and {*}Professor Willard{*Willard-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a little bit busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned of the existence of the Ark while searching for Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,An "ark of miracles," protected by the Sirius for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Within it lie all kinds of knowledge and technologies.{HA, it was ark. Suck it, random nyaa commenter.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:14:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To humanity, it's like wisdom itself in physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So said the legends, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I simply wanted to discover whether it really existed or was just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your patrons wanted a bit more than that.{i don't know how to keep this simple but also make the meaning clear}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something the vampires need among the knowledge and technologies the Ark holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So my father knew what the Ark was, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he took it away from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:34.76,Default,TLC,2,2,0,,From my research, I gathered that the Ark was to be\Nprotected by one with the blood of the Sirius in their veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's alive, then he's most likely protecting the Ark somewhere, but if he isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"You need to do the thing that only you can do."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What only I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.57,0:14:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,what only a remnant of the Sirius can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If that thing is protecting the Ark of Sirius...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something I can do for my slain mother and kin other than hunting vampires...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I want to look for the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kershner was merely a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the vampire who truly desires the Ark is Yevgraf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's most likely closer than anyone else to finding the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From the east to the west coast...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:49.00,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,So it's spread over almost the entire continent. {I don't know what coasts, or if continent is even the right word (Lit "area") Will look into it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, lord.{oho}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The sickness is spreading to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:16:00.06,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,A veil of death, descending upon our entire race...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yev, Lord Yev{*Yev-sama, Yev-sama}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,News from Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They said Kershner's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mikhail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that Misha and\NGrampa Klarw are coming to meet us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To meet us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy, I fixed your coat—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you all helped clean up for like five minutes and already need a break? {"You all are already exhausted from helping clean up just a little bit?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're all tired from yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, I'll have you know that I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, so's Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body is pretty crazy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he had to go contact headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The owner of this place helped me out a bit.{i never know what to do with these awkward "too"s}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to drink one in his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't take you for the dutiful type.{dutiful as in?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going after more vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the Ark of Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That could affect the very existence of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have me believe such a thing really exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,An understandable reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I, for instance, said to your face that there's no such thing as vampires,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:47.40,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,could you present any proof that there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Akasaka Mamoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This man received top-secret orders to find and acquire the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,However, fifteen years ago we lost contact with him while he was in central Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Great War, searching for the captain was low on our list of priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to the recent global depression and the situation with the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we decided to give the Ark our attention again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to covertly search for the Ark of Sirius in Captain Akasaka's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and find and acquire it before any other country has the chance to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the Empire will depend on whether we have possession of the Ark or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As unbelievable as that may sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I being entrusted with such a vital mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, I still don't have enough information to complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,V Shipping...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, the Jaegers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're in contact with a man who works for them named "Willard."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was once considered the greatest living expert on legends about the Sirius in academic circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We've learned of the events that prompted you to bring troops to the Naoe residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Intelligence's rising star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the man's friend now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So just because I helped you,\NI got stuck doing this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,An unfortunate turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not just saying that, then help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen the man in this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is something else I could tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The vampires are also after the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After I informed headquarters that we've completed our mission here in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they replied that the vampire that's searching for the Ark, Yevgraf, was seen at Karafuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Karafuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we even now, Major Iba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,More than even.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Mister Willard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,are you not after the Ark anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:20:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for the Ark isn't my specialty anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yevgraf?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we going to that "Karafuto" place now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.09,0:20:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Another team's headed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to go to London and report in at headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,London?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally going back to Europe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're probably the closest team to Karafuto right now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.01,0:20:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders from Headquarters are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yuliy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do you not like my hometown?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happier if it at least had some decent grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Your country's no different!{lmao, don't tell the irish that they're no different from brits}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It most certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like I don't like being with everyone or being a Jaeger anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've found what I should really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuliy, we are a cooperative pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We chase our prey wherever\Nthey flee, corner them, and eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.31,0:23:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked the idea of being part of a pack like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is something I have to do by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I'm saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An eternal seal, unbreakable to all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:35.97,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Are you really a Jaeger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you become a vampire, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.24,0:23:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
