Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:45.48,ED,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:06.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{OP lyrics start}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:08.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}What an unbearable end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:15.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}I breath out, breath out, breath out, and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:22.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}As I'm fleeing from this cruel world, I fall into a deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:29.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}I hide behind the words "I'm doing my best"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}But in the end I do nothing but look back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:40.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Even when I feel like I've been able to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:45.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Eventually I realize that the only thing that's changed is the position of the stars
